      "headliner": "Company Profile",
      "slugline": "Who is DATBOX and what do they produce?",
      "prime_lore": "DATBOX is a ROM producer inside ALICE_BOX. \nTheir primary product line are BOX ROMs, apps which collect dat cards into store boxes. These data materials ('datmats') are stored in .*box format according to their box type. Stored dat cards are usable materials for future projects and products, stored conveniently for easy access, control, and alteration during production.\n\n*DATBOX Studios - We have a box for dat!*",
